{"schemaVersion":1,"id":493,"sections":[{"id":"1912001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20664],"start":0,"count":15},{"id":"1912001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20665],"start":15,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:1","scriptId":20664,"text":"几波诱敌之后，消灭了不少旅行者。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:2","scriptId":20664,"text":"感觉周围没有危险之后，把小队收拢开始一波弹药补给。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:3","scriptId":20664,"text":"“呼……虽然我们人不多，但敌人不动脑子，只会盯着安妮我们就有机可乘了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:4","scriptId":20664,"text":"“这个数量的敌人都游刃有余，换做普通的队伍可能已经全灭了，指挥官同志的队伍原来那么神勇的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:5","scriptId":20664,"text":"“我们可是死水的精锐部队啊，怎么能和一般的队伍相提并论。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":1135,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:6","scriptId":20664,"text":"“不过安妮也不错啊，面对轮番轰炸也没有表现出一丝畏惧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:7","scriptId":20664,"text":"“是啊，我原本考虑让佩妮或者佐伊打一下援护，不过现在看来实在有点杞人忧天。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:8","scriptId":20664,"text":"“哪里……和指挥官同志的队员配合里我感觉到了信任和关怀，大家都是可靠的伙伴。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:9","scriptId":20664,"text":"“我们的补给也是有限的，持久战上会比较不利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:10","scriptId":20664,"text":"“是的，此地不宜久留。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:11","scriptId":20664,"text":"“还没法解开安妮的项圈，我们也不方便留下安妮一人去做补给。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1134,"speaker":"救助者1号","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:12","scriptId":20664,"text":"“周围出现无法识别的生物信号。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:13","scriptId":20664,"text":"突然救助者1号发出了警报，自从救出了安妮之后，它就成了安妮的保镖一直跟在她的左右。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:14","scriptId":20664,"text":"不过有了它的探测功能可以完全防御偷袭，这点倒是出乎意料的好用。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-PROLOGUE:20664:15","scriptId":20664,"text":"不得不感叹波西娅的开发能力，老是会在一些意想不到的地方发挥功能……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:1","scriptId":20665,"text":"这次的伏击没有成功……先头的敌人虽然是被击杀了，但后续的敌人竟然选择了撤退。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:2","scriptId":20665,"text":"“怎么回事，刚才还有效的作战……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1134,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:3","scriptId":20665,"text":"“终于理解我们的强大之处，所以就放弃了？。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:4","scriptId":20665,"text":"“是那样就好了，事情应该没那么简单。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:5","scriptId":20665,"text":"“是的呢，敌人在这时候的异常之举反而应该多加注意。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:6","scriptId":20665,"text":"“加强防范。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":596,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1135,"speaker":"安妮·沃佳诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:7","scriptId":20665,"text":"“从外表完全看不出你们都是身经百战的老手啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":596,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:8","scriptId":20665,"text":"“先安全完成任务吧，敌人可是旅行者，乐极生悲可就划不来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":1135,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"1912001-EPILOGUE:20665:9","scriptId":20665,"text":"“长官说的没错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
